      en: ["The original foundation was established by settler Francisco de Inocêncio de Sousa.", "Caconda was the most important Portuguese center in the Planalto in the 18th century.", "The fort was rebuilt in 1769 following wars with the Humbe peoples.", "Naturalist José Alberto de Oliveira Anchieta passed away in Caconda in 1897.", "The region is known for its fertile soils and agricultural importance.", "The ruins underwent partial archaeological investigations in the 1990s."],
