      en: ["The construction was carried out under the direction of Governor Francisco Inocêncio de Sousa Coutinho.", "The fort was built on a small island that was later connected to the mainland via land reclamation.", "It served as a central prison for the PIDE secret police during the colonial era.", "The facility was designated a national cultural heritage site in 1992.", "The fortress is constructed from limestone and granite.", "Today, the fort is located near Luanda's modern container terminal."],
      es: ["Construida en el siglo XVIII sobre una roca estratégica.", "Originalmente una fortaleza insular aislada en el puerto de Luanda.", "Sirvió como notoria prisión de alta seguridad de la PIDE.", "Lugar central de conmemoración de los héroes del 4 de febrero.", "Incluida en la lista del patrimonio cultural nacional en 1992.", "Ofrece una visión profunda de las casamatas y celdas históricas.", "Emblema de la lucha contra el fascismo y el colonialismo.", "Parte de la red de museos prevista para la capital."],
